            <div xml:id="d649">

                <pb facs="0135" n="1185" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v11p2/pg1185"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">357.AB/2–452</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum of Conversation, by the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            type="conversation-or-meeting-date" when="1952-02-04">February 4,
                            1952</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">White House Dictation</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#center">Item No. 2</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">Kashmir—Dr. Graham</p>
                <p>I discussed the importance of Dr. Graham’s
                    making another effort in India to settle the Kashmir dispute. The President
                    approves of his going and has sent him word to that effect.</p>
            </div>
